---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PhotoCard from '../components/PhotoCard.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Impact"
  description="See the impact Dosis Kardia Foundation has made in the lives of vulnerable, street-connected children in Port Harcourt, Nigeria."
>
  <section class="pt-40 pb-16 px-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl text-umber font-semibold">
      The power of giving.
    </h1>
  </section>

  <!-- Written narratively for now since we don't yet have hard figures
       (children reached, meals served, dates). Once those are available,
       a stats/counter section (the same count-up used on the homepage)
       can be added here for stronger credibility with donors. -->
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pb-24 text-ink/75 leading-relaxed space-y-5">
    <p>
      For four years now, Dosis Kardia Foundation has been visiting young
      people on the streets of Port Harcourt, homeless and otherwise,
      showing up consistently for children with no parental care or
      support.
    </p>

    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <PhotoCard src="/images/impact/gallery-1.jpg" alt="Food distribution to children" aspect="aspect-[4/3]" />
      <PhotoCard src="/images/impact/gallery-2.jpg" alt="Children with learning materials" aspect="aspect-[4/3]" />
    </div>

    <p>
      We teach and disciple them in the Word of God, clothe and feed them,
      and attend to their medical needs. We have also supported access to
      education by providing learning materials and guidance, and by
      sponsoring some of these young people through school.
    </p>
    <p>
      Through our regular visits, we have facilitated access to basic
      healthcare, addressing urgent medical needs and promoting overall
      well-being.
    </p>

    <PhotoCard
      src="/images/impact/gallery-3.jpg"
      alt="A child receiving medical care"
      aspect="aspect-[16/7]"
    />
  </section>
</Layout>
